{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：13:55 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"珍惜生命│紅磡海逸道29歲女子墮樓 當場不治\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94c0187b2e00c460907da98399fc852c/2026-10/PW241002LV001.jpg\"/>\n<p>紅磡海逸道8號其中一座樓，今（16日）中午1時03分，一名女子報案指其29歲姓黃女兒企圖墮樓輕生，惟警方及消防員接報到場，女事主已告墮下，倒臥平台，奄奄一息。救護員經檢驗後，證實事主當場不治。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，正調查其輕生原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:39:56.820746+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:55:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:18:05.942107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:37:56.834485+00:00","content_hash":"6c19a2e6cb0c4c06707a034746ec73a3fd65c9bbff25c9677077733c1e2a1f06","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}